  "statuteText": "153-A:32 Automated External Defibrillator Registry. –\n\nThere shall be established in the department of safety a registry for all automated external defibrillators in the state. The department is authorized to release information from the registry to first responders in an emergency through the enhanced 911 system. Registration shall include the address and precise location of the automated external defibrillator."
